      "content": [
        "2 Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "toc2",
      "content": [
        "2 Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "toc3",
      "content": [
        "2TI"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "mt1",
      "content": [
        "2 Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "1",
      "sid": "2TI 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Paul’s Greeting to Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "1TI 1:1-2",
          "content": [
            "1 Timothy 1:1–2"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "2TI 1:1"
        },
        "Paul, an apostle of Christ Jesus by ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " will of God, according to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " promise of life in Christ Jesus,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "2TI 1:2"
        },
        "To Timothy, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " beloved child:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "Grace, mercy, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " peace from God ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Father and Christ Jesus our Lord."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Faithfulness under Persecution"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "MAT 10:16-25",
          "content": [
            "Matthew 10:16–25"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "2TI 1:3"
        },
        "I thank God, whom I serve with a clear conscience as did ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " forefathers, as I constantly remember you night and day in my prayers. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "2TI 1:4"
        },
        "Recalling your tears, I long to see you so that I may be filled with joy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "2TI 1:5"
        },
        "I am reminded of your sincere faith, which first dwelt in your grandmother Lois and your mother Eunice, and I am convinced ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " in you as well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "2TI 1:6"
        },
        "For this reason I remind you to fan into flame the gift of God, which is in you through the laying on of my hands. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "2TI 1:7"
        },
        "For God ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "has"
          ]
        },
        " not given us a spirit of fear,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:7 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "timidity "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "cowardice"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " but of power, love, and self-control."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "2TI 1:8"
        },
        "So do not be ashamed of the testimony of our Lord, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " of me, His prisoner. Instead, join me in suffering for the gospel by ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " power of God. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "2TI 1:9"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "He"
          ]
        },
        " has saved us and called ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        " to a holy calling, not because of our works, but by His own purpose and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "by the"
          ]
        },
        " grace He granted us in Christ Jesus before time began.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:9 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "before times eternal"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "2TI 1:10"
        },
        "And now He has revealed ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "this grace"
          ]
        },
        " through the appearing of our Savior, Christ Jesus, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who"
          ]
        },
        " has abolished death and illuminated the way to life and immortality through the gospel, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "2TI 1:11"
        },
        "to which I was appointed ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as"
          ]
        },
        " a preacher, an apostle, and a teacher."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "2TI 1:12"
        },
        "For this reason, even ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "though"
          ]
        },
        " I suffer ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as I do"
          ]
        },
        ", I am not ashamed; for I know whom I have believed, and I am convinced that He is able to guard what I have entrusted ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to Him"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:12 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "what He has entrusted to me"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " for that day."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Holding to Sound Teaching"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "2TI 1:13"
        },
        "Hold on ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to the"
          ]
        },
        " pattern of sound teaching",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:13 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "sound words"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " you have heard from me, with ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " faith and love that ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "are"
          ]
        },
        " in Christ Jesus. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "2TI 1:14"
        },
        "Guard the treasure entrusted ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to you"
          ]
        },
        ",",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:14 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "the good deposit entrusted to you"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " with the help of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Holy Spirit who dwells in us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "2TI 1:15"
        },
        "You know that everyone in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the province of"
          ]
        },
        " Asia",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:15 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "in Asia"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "; Asia was a Roman province in what is now western Turkey. "
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " has deserted me, including Phygelus and Hermogenes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "2TI 1:16"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "May"
          ]
        },
        " the Lord grant mercy to the household of Onesiphorus, because he has often refreshed me and was unashamed of my chains. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "2TI 1:17"
        },
        "Indeed, when he arrived in Rome, he searched diligently ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "until"
          ]
        },
        " he found me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "2TI 1:18"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "May"
          ]
        },
        " the Lord grant ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Onesiphorus"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "His"
          ]
        },
        " mercy on that day. You know very well how much he ministered ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to me"
          ]
        },
        " in Ephesus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "2",
      "sid": "2TI 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Grace and Perseverance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "HEB 12:1-3",
          "content": [
            "Hebrews 12:1–3"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "2TI 2:1"
        },
        "You therefore, my child, be strong in the grace that ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " in Christ Jesus. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "2TI 2:2"
        },
        "And the things that you have heard me ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "say"
          ]
        },
        " among many witnesses, entrust these to faithful men who will be qualified to teach others as well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "2TI 2:3"
        },
        "Join me in suffering, like ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        " good soldier of Christ Jesus. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "2TI 2:4"
        },
        "A soldier refrains from entangling himself in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "civilian"
          ]
        },
        " affairs, in order to please the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one who"
          ]
        },
        " enlisted him. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "2TI 2:5"
        },
        "Likewise, a competitor does not receive the crown unless he competes according to the rules. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "2TI 2:6"
        },
        "The hardworking farmer should be the first to partake of the crops. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "2TI 2:7"
        },
        "Consider what I am saying, for the Lord will give you insight into all things."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "2TI 2:8"
        },
        "Remember Jesus Christ, raised from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " dead, descended from David, as proclaimed by my gospel, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "2TI 2:9"
        },
        "for which I suffer to the extent of being chained like a criminal. But the word of God cannot be chained! ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "2TI 2:10"
        },
        "For this reason I endure all things for the sake of the elect, so that they too may obtain ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " salvation that ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " in Christ Jesus, with eternal glory."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "2TI 2:11"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "This is a"
          ]
        },
        " trustworthy saying:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "b"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q1",
      "content": [
        "If we died ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "with Him"
          ]
        },
        ","
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "we will also live ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "with Him"
          ]
        },
        ";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q1",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "2TI 2:12"
        },
        "if we endure,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "we will also reign ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "with Him"
          ]
        },
        ";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q1",
      "content": [
        "if we deny ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Him"
          ]
        },
        ","
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "He will also deny us;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q1",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "2TI 2:13"
        },
        "if we are faithless,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "He remains faithful,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "for He cannot deny Himself."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "The Lord’s Approved Workman"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "2TI 2:14"
        },
        "Remind  ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the believers "
          ]
        },
        " of these things, charging ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "them"
          ]
        },
        " before God",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:14 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "SBL, BYZ, and TR "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "the Lord"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " to avoid quarreling over words, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "which"
          ]
        },
        " succeeds only in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "leading"
          ]
        },
        " the listeners to ruin."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "2TI 2:15"
        },
        "Make every effort to present yourself approved to God, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "an"
          ]
        },
        " unashamed workman who accurately handles the word of truth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "2TI 2:16"
        },
        "But avoid irreverent, empty chatter, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "which"
          ]
        },
        " will ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "only"
          ]
        },
        " lead to more ungodliness, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "2TI 2:17"
        },
        "and the talk of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "such men"
          ]
        },
        " will spread like gangrene. Among ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "them"
          ]
        },
        " are Hymenaeus and Philetus, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "2TI 2:18"
        },
        "who have deviated from the truth. They say that the resurrection has already occurred, and they undermine the faith of some."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "2TI 2:19"
        },
        "Nevertheless, God’s firm foundation stands, bearing this seal: “",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "The"
          ]
        },
        " Lord knows those who are His,”",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:19 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "ref",
                  "loc": "NUM 16:5",
                  "content": [
                    "Numbers 16:5"
                  ]
                },
                " (see also LXX)"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " and, “Everyone who calls on the name of the Lord must turn away from iniquity.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "2TI 2:20"
        },
        "A large house contains not only vessels of gold and silver, but also of wood and clay. Some indeed ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "are"
          ]
        },
        " for honorable ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "use"
          ]
        },
        ", but others ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "are"
          ]
        },
        " for common ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "use"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "2TI 2:21"
        },
        "So if anyone cleanses himself of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "what is unfit"
          ]
        },
        ",",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:21 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "cleanses himself of these"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " he will be a vessel for honor: sanctified, useful to the Master, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " prepared for every good work."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "22",
          "sid": "2TI 2:22"
        },
        "Flee from youthful passions and pursue righteousness, faith, love, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " peace, together with those who call on the Lord out of a pure heart."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "23",
          "sid": "2TI 2:23"
        },
        "But reject foolish and ignorant speculation, for you know that it breeds quarreling. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "24",
          "sid": "2TI 2:24"
        },
        "And a servant of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Lord must not be quarrelsome, but must be kind to everyone, able to teach, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " forbearing. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "25",
          "sid": "2TI 2:25"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "He must"
          ]
        },
        " gently reprove those who oppose ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "him"
          ]
        },
        ", in the hope that God may grant them repentance leading to a knowledge of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " truth. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "26",
          "sid": "2TI 2:26"
        },
        "Then they will come to their senses ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and escape"
          ]
        },
        " the snare of the devil, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who"
          ]
        },
        " has taken them captive to his will."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "3",
      "sid": "2TI 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Evil in the Last Days"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "2TI 3:1"
        },
        "But understand this: In ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " last days terrible times will come. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "2TI 3:2"
        },
        "For men will be lovers of themselves, lovers of money, boastful, arrogant, abusive, disobedient to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " parents, ungrateful, unholy, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "2TI 3:3"
        },
        "unloving, unforgiving, slanderous, without self-control, brutal, without love of good, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "2TI 3:4"
        },
        "traitorous, reckless, conceited, lovers of pleasure rather than lovers of God, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "2TI 3:5"
        },
        "having a form of godliness but denying its power. Turn away from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "such"
          ]
        },
        " as these!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "2TI 3:6"
        },
        "They are the kind who worm their way into households and captivate vulnerable women ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who are"
          ]
        },
        " weighed down with sins ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " led astray by various passions, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "2TI 3:7"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who are"
          ]
        },
        " always learning ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " never able to come to a knowledge of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " truth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "2TI 3:8"
        },
        "Just as Jannes and Jambres opposed Moses,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:8 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "See ",
                {
                  "type": "ref",
                  "loc": "79:27",
                  "content": [
                    "Jasher 79:27"
                  ]
                },
                ". "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "The Book of Jashar "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "the Book of the Upright One "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "is often cited as "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Jasher"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " so also these men oppose the truth. They are depraved in mind ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " disqualified from the faith. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "2TI 3:9"
        },
        "But they will not advance much further. For just like ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Jannes and Jambres"
          ]
        },
        ", their folly will be plain to everyone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "All Scripture Is God-Breathed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "HEB 4:12-16",
          "content": [
            "Hebrews 4:12–16"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "2TI 3:10"
        },
        "You, however, have observed my teaching, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " conduct, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " purpose, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " faith, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " patience, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " love, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " perseverance, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "2TI 3:11"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " persecutions, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and the"
          ]
        },
        " sufferings that came upon me in Antioch, Iconium, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " Lystra. What persecutions I endured! Yet the Lord rescued me from all ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "of them"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "2TI 3:12"
        },
        "Indeed, all who desire to live godly ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "lives"
          ]
        },
        " in Christ Jesus will be persecuted, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "2TI 3:13"
        },
        "while evil men and imposters go ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "from bad"
          ]
        },
        " to worse, deceiving and being deceived."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "2TI 3:14"
        },
        "But ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as for"
          ]
        },
        " you, continue in the things you have learned and firmly believed, since you know from whom you have learned ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "them"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "2TI 3:15"
        },
        "From infancy you have known the Holy Scriptures, which are able to make you wise for salvation through faith in Christ Jesus. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "2TI 3:16"
        },
        "All Scripture ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " God-breathed and is useful for instruction, for conviction, for correction, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " for training in righteousness, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "2TI 3:17"
        },
        "so that the man of God may be complete, fully equipped for every good work."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "4",
      "sid": "2TI 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Preach the Word"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "2TI 4:1"
        },
        "I charge ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "you"
          ]
        },
        " in the presence of God and of Christ Jesus, who will judge ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " living and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " dead, and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "in view"
          ]
        },
        " of His appearing and His kingdom: ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "2TI 4:2"
        },
        "Preach the word; be prepared in season ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " out of season; reprove, rebuke, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " encourage with every ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "form of"
          ]
        },
        " patient instruction."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "2TI 4:3"
        },
        "For ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " time will come when men will not tolerate sound doctrine, but with itching ears they will gather around themselves teachers to suit ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " own desires. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "2TI 4:4"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "So"
          ]
        },
        " they will turn ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " ears ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "away"
          ]
        },
        " from the truth and turn aside to myths."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "2TI 4:5"
        },
        "But you, be sober in all things, endure hardship, do ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " work of an evangelist, fulfill your ministry. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "2TI 4:6"
        },
        "For I ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "am"
          ]
        },
        " already being poured out like a drink offering, and the time of my departure is at hand. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "2TI 4:7"
        },
        "I have fought the good fight, I have finished the race, I have kept the faith. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "2TI 4:8"
        },
        "From now on there is laid up for me the crown of righteousness, which the Lord, the righteous Judge, will award to me on that day — and not only to me, but to all who crave His appearing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Personal Concerns"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "2TI 4:9"
        },
        "Make every effort to come to me quickly, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "2TI 4:10"
        },
        "because Demas, in his love of this ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "world"
          ]
        },
        ", has deserted me and gone to Thessalonica. Crescens ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "has gone"
          ]
        },
        " to Galatia, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " Titus to Dalmatia. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "2TI 4:11"
        },
        "Only Luke is with me. Get Mark ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " bring ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "him"
          ]
        },
        " with you, because he is useful to me in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " ministry. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "2TI 4:12"
        },
        "Tychicus, however, I have sent to Ephesus. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "2TI 4:13"
        },
        "When you come, bring the cloak that I left with Carpus at Troas, and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " scrolls, especially the parchments."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "2TI 4:14"
        },
        "Alexander the coppersmith did great harm to me. The Lord will repay him according to his deeds. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "2TI 4:15"
        },
        "You too should beware of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "him"
          ]
        },
        ", for he has vigorously opposed our message."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "The Lord Remains Faithful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "2TI 4:16"
        },
        "At my first defense, no one stood with me, but everyone deserted me. May it not be charged against them. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "2TI 4:17"
        },
        "But the Lord stood by me and strengthened me, so that through me the message would be fully proclaimed, and all the Gentiles would hear ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "it"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "So"
          ]
        },
        " I was delivered from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " mouth of the lion. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "2TI 4:18"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "And"
          ]
        },
        " the Lord will rescue me from every evil action and bring ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "me"
          ]
        },
        " safely into His heavenly kingdom. To Him ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "be"
          ]
        },
        " the glory forever ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " ever. Amen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Final Greetings"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "EPH 6:21-24",
          "content": [
            "Ephesians 6:21–24"
          ]
        },
        "; ",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "PHP 4:21-23",
          "content": [
            "Philippians 4:21–23"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "2TI 4:19"
        },
        "Greet Prisca",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "4:19 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Prisca "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "is a variant of "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Priscilla"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "; see ",
                {
                  "type": "ref",
                  "loc": "ACT 18:2",
                  "content": [
                    "Acts 18:2"
                  ]
                },
                "."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " and Aquila, as well as the household of Onesiphorus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "2TI 4:20"
        },
        "Erastus has remained at Corinth, and Trophimus I left sick in Miletus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "2TI 4:21"
        },
        "Make every effort to come  ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to me "
          ]
        },
        " before winter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "Eubulus sends you greetings, as do Pudens, Linus, Claudia, and all the brothers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "22",
          "sid": "2TI 4:22"
        },
        "The Lord ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "be"
          ]
        },
        " with your spirit. Grace ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "be"
          ]
        },
        " with you all.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "4:22 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR include "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Amen."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}